<title>USA: Physician Reliance says Michael Murdock CFO.</title>
<headline>Physician Reliance says Michael Murdock CFO.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Physician Reliance Network Inc said Wednesday it named Michaael Murdock chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Murdock was previously senior vice president and chief financial officer of Dallas-based Intecare, an entity established to help consolidate not-for-profit healthcare systems.</p>
<p>The company announced in December Randall Kurtz resigned as CFO to start a physicians' management consulting firm.</p>
<p>Physicians Reliance is an oncology practice management company.</p>
